{"signature": "b8d3e989c7cf27d96ef191e1c4286f7fdc29d2f8aa8e7e03f934f25523433474", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "linear", "file": "data.json", "pointer": "/issues", "field": "identifier", "values": ["ENG-1980", "ENG-2032", "ENG-2190", "ENG-574", "ENG-906"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1887", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-1980", "record": {"id": "ENG-1980", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1980", "number": 1980, "title": "5-23 issue about the pity mechanic", "description": "Chrashlytics Link: [https://console.firebase.google.com/project/domino-delights/crashlytics/app/android:com.harmonygames.dominodelights/issues/c6cb09ac48e9653ece2d0799b2f9e775?time=last-thirty-days&types=crash&sessionEventKey=674F252B00FD00012EFEF01B08DED502_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_5928]](https://console.firebase.google.com/project/domino-delights/crashlytics/app/android:com.harmonygames.dominodelights/issues/c6cb09ac48e9653ece2d0799b2f9e775?time=last-thirty-days&types=crash&sessionEventKey=674F252B00FD00012EFEF01B08DED502_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_5928])\n\nThe Script / Function:  **GoD.Scripts.CoreGame.DynamicDifficulty.DynamicDifficulty.HandlePityMechanic**\n\n**java.lang.Exception - IndexOutOfRangeException : Index was outside the bounds of the array.**\n\n**GoD.Scripts.CoreGame.DynamicDifficulty.DynamicDifficulty**\n\nFurther Detail:\n\nIt's about the broken 5-23 is fixed now.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-12-03T17:05:05Z", "completed_at": "2024-12-09T16:39:45Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-06-10T12:16:15Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 620815, "labels": ["Crashlytics", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-12-03T17:05:05Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-09T16:39:45Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1945", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2032", "record": {"id": "ENG-2032", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2032", "number": 2032, "title": "FTUE quests are not counted once they are visible", "description": "Version or date: android 111 submission\n\n### Description: \n\nThe FTUE quests are available in the saga map after 1-10 but the quests are not counted as completed even though they're completed. Players need to redo the same quests to count them as completed. \n\n### Visual References:\n\n[Record_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_5968]_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.mp4]([URL_51873])\n\n### Expected Outcome: is to count the quests as completed as soon as the FTUE quest icon is visible in the saga map. \n\n### Steps to Repro:\n\n1. Unlock FTUE quests\n2. Change your avatar or name\n3. Observe that they don't count as completed.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-01-03T15:44:00Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 584870, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-12-30T13:07:21Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-03T15:44:00Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2115", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2190", "record": {"id": "ENG-2190", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2190", "number": 2190, "title": "Players' names are not visible in the first try event for low-end android devices", "description": "Version or date: android submission 149\n\n### Description: \n\nThere are many other places that texts are not visible for low-end android devices. But that problem is a little bit different. \n\nIt sometimes shows the players' names but sometimes not. My biggest theory on that, if Nate's treasure hunt scene is triggered in the background, the texts aren't visible for that session. They're kind of cursed and is not visible at all. \n\n### Visual References:\n\n![Screenshot_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6095]-59_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.jpg]([URL_52133])\n\n### Expected Outcome: is to show the name texts no matter what. \n\n### Steps to Repro:\n\n1. Low end android device\n2. Start Nate's Treasure Hunt and proceed \n3. Start first try event\n4. Observe that the texts are not visible when they are overlapped.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 508355, "labels": ["Bug", "Pupusa"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-02-21T16:11:24Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T19:34:50Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2728", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-574", "record": {"id": "ENG-574", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c557a2ae624e4fa1", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-574", "number": 574, "title": "VFX On Match Domino", "description": "We need sparks as well yo come out of the matched tile when you tap on it. See video below.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-03-20T16:49:08Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T21:31:44Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 959846, "labels": ["VFX Integration", "Improvement", "Sprint 14 - March 29th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-02-05T18:46:14Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T21:31:44Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3077", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-906", "record": {"id": "ENG-906", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ART-552", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-906", "number": 906, "title": "Sound for Streak Announcer", "description": "Using AI voice for each character\n\nList of text to be provided by Leonard:\n\n 1. Brilliant!\n 2. Fantastic!\n 3. Phenomenal!\n 4. Impressive!\n 5. Awesome!\n 6. Incredible!\n 7. Spectacular!\n 8. Extraordinary!\n 9. Remarkable!\n10. Well Done!", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-06-26T15:15:33Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 859939, "labels": ["Streak System"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-05-16T18:17:28Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-26T15:15:33Z"}}], "records_checked": 3852, "files_selected": 1, "files_completed": 1, "scan_complete": true, "errors": []}}, "files_read_this_call": 1, "sources": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "manifest_sha256": "b299d01377efd99db02ba7f6bb072a6d539b00d970b492b9e79b68353d3f5310", "freshness": "582618486f6bf42cadf2f5773c59d065e6e938d2e6a872db0c1e27305c9165fd"}], "scan_complete": true, "persona_filtered": false, "backend": "grouped-record-scan", "scope_note": "Exact direct fields in selected arrays. No SQL is applied. Absence/uniqueness is supported only within complete declared scopes. Manifest hashes are declared provenance, not fresh full-content hashes."}, "checksum": "f36d07f99f7960836d71a8bac38298feeb5513d6ca0f7309ff27510621d6a374"}